><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the surface integral can be written as</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"40\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 23.345em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222C TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.217em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi